
USAGE: 

   test132 assets  <command> ... [-h] [--version] [--format <string>]
                   [--project <string>]


Where: 

Commands:

   register
     Register an asset

   list
     List assets

   All options, including global options, must follow the complete command
   path.

   --format <string>
     Output format for every command

   --project <string>
     Project for all asset commands

   --,  --ignore_rest
     Ignores the rest of the labeled arguments following this flag.

   --version
     Displays version information and exits.

   -h,  --help
     Displays usage information and exits.

   Manage assets

